                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To alienate (property) in mortmain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b12ebc4c-6d7a-350c-b073-e9db7dbb15b0",
                                        "entry_id": "31ceb372-bce2-3ff6-b7e7-a7b2b75d74c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To wipe out (a debt, liability etc.) gradually or in installments."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b93aae7e-8d6a-484b-8b81-bc7709584047",
                                                "sense_id": "b12ebc4c-6d7a-350c-b073-e9db7dbb15b0",
                                                "text": "extraordinary borrowing had been so extensive, Joly de Fleury reckoned, that even if it were amortized over the following decade, the state would still be running an annual deficit of over 50 million livres."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "617a07ec-65f2-3104-970e-5aa3b559c765",
                                        "entry_id": "31ceb372-bce2-3ff6-b7e7-a7b2b75d74c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To even out the costs of running an algorithm over many iterations, so that high-cost iterations are much less frequent than low-cost iterations, which lowers the average running time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "955cd371-23bd-48c1-bbbf-4d973d3d4d2a",
                        "source_entry_id": "849d8096-6f48-3ea7-bcb2-06871c7c7ec1",
                        "target_lang_word": "pay off",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pay off",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c8e4804-e7ba-38cb-804b-bda7583cae1d",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf5dbbe-81db-3247-9072-271078e8a07e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bribe, especially to deter oversight."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb5567b9-e7f7-4c19-928b-1b267b6f6f64",
                                                "sense_id": "5c8e4804-e7ba-38cb-804b-bda7583cae1d",
                                                "text": "I thought the guards would give us trouble, but apparently he had paid them off."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5ff3b9a3-bca4-4ea2-ad8d-30f5b4c9f2ae",
                                                "sense_id": "5c8e4804-e7ba-38cb-804b-bda7583cae1d",
                                                "text": "I had to pay off the judge to get my license back."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d7016f1-cdc5-39ba-996d-8f431dacef0c",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf5dbbe-81db-3247-9072-271078e8a07e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To become worthwhile; to produce a net benefit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7196b1f-1ddf-464b-bc50-4bb64924a32b",
                                                "sense_id": "7d7016f1-cdc5-39ba-996d-8f431dacef0c",
                                                "text": "Her years of Spanish classes finally paid off when she found herself in Mexico and realized she could communicate with people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1447b58-437b-4a8a-a5d1-20c5d39c7779",
                                                "sense_id": "7d7016f1-cdc5-39ba-996d-8f431dacef0c",
                                                "text": "Wenger sent on Cesc Fabregas and Van Persie to try to finish Leeds off and with 14 minutes left the switch paid off as the Spaniard sent Bendtner away down the right and his wonderful curling cross was headed in by Van Persie at the far post."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc352196-49b4-39b7-8f21-0dbb1534870f",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf5dbbe-81db-3247-9072-271078e8a07e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pay back; to repay."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81d24fb7-3a46-4138-8b8b-7c41c110d167",
                                                "sense_id": "fc352196-49b4-39b7-8f21-0dbb1534870f",
                                                "text": "He paid off the loan three months early."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8bd2b79-2c6c-4b83-b5fb-5db3e7eb0a52",
                                                "sense_id": "fc352196-49b4-39b7-8f21-0dbb1534870f",
                                                "text": "What Pimp was asking me to do was crazy. Off the fuckin' chain. Insane. He was scheming to stick up T.C. and Miss Lady's pool hall so we could pay off G, but a playa like me was getting ready to go to college and put all that two-bit robbing and stealing shit behind me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c0b04cd-ad35-3701-9829-07fe31297f1d",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf5dbbe-81db-3247-9072-271078e8a07e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pay back (repay) the entirety of a loan, thereby effecting the release of a lien on (the thing that was financed)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce96b1c5-03cd-414d-be1b-3bcc943f3c9a",
                                                "sense_id": "3c0b04cd-ad35-3701-9829-07fe31297f1d",
                                                "text": "This contract requires you to pay off the car by 2025."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02c15545-f05d-337a-af4a-1135ee0e1b11",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf5dbbe-81db-3247-9072-271078e8a07e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pay and discharge (an employee)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf67ca33-20df-41c0-ab98-e81828e7c256",
                                                "sense_id": "02c15545-f05d-337a-af4a-1135ee0e1b11",
                                                "text": "The cook, who had been an indifferent worker on the trip over, came aboard drunk and was immediately paid off. Amazingly, twenty men applied to fill the vacancy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18829acf-96ff-344c-9894-42be21963ce5",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf5dbbe-81db-3247-9072-271078e8a07e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fall to leeward, as the head of a vessel under sail."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b8f68a91-b8c2-4f0b-9d71-bc18874bb658",
                        "source_entry_id": "849d8096-6f48-3ea7-bcb2-06871c7c7ec1",
                        "target_lang_word": "amortir",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "amortir",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "579ce88a-7ac3-3eb3-9111-37f6a8bc6dd5",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rendre moins ardent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5be2c345-7f12-443a-b6b7-6265a20ea022",
                                                "sense_id": "579ce88a-7ac3-3eb3-9111-37f6a8bc6dd5",
                                                "text": "Ce feu est trop ardent, il faut y jeter de l’eau pour l’amortir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2381e920-acd0-49e0-bfeb-56ec2d83f2b7",
                                                "sense_id": "579ce88a-7ac3-3eb3-9111-37f6a8bc6dd5",
                                                "text": "Amortir le feu, la chaleur d’un érésipèle par des lotions émollientes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed1ef1c4-09a3-4866-84c6-588bdae38330",
                                                "sense_id": "579ce88a-7ac3-3eb3-9111-37f6a8bc6dd5",
                                                "text": "Lorsque la chaleur semblait diminuer, la mère Chapdelaine disait d’un ton inquiet :\n— Ne laissez pas amortir le feu, les enfants !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "738c8d36-af7b-3919-97bd-b422e34c6735",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rendre un coup moins fort en affaiblissant son effet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc259f23-521e-4bdb-9ec0-13f392c34966",
                                                "sense_id": "738c8d36-af7b-3919-97bd-b422e34c6735",
                                                "text": "Très heureusement, la neige, en s'amoncelant autour de ses murs, amortissait le coup des rafales."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1eba9ad-3f9c-31b1-9055-fac26b7e5858",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Soumettre à une macération."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "773610dd-d807-40cd-871a-7721c5769cae",
                                                "sense_id": "f1eba9ad-3f9c-31b1-9055-fac26b7e5858",
                                                "text": "Amortir une viande, le cuir. (Par extension) Amortir la chaux vive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4111f12-a288-32d4-9d35-b0781afa366e",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rendre moins vifs, moins éclatants, des couleurs, des sons, …"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90191879-3a83-4707-a658-94cab9b8e76f",
                                                "sense_id": "d4111f12-a288-32d4-9d35-b0781afa366e",
                                                "text": "Ces couleurs sont un peu trop vives et trop dures, il faut les amortir par des nuances plus douces."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3560eb8-9ca9-45f0-8b33-3c07885d1b11",
                                                "sense_id": "d4111f12-a288-32d4-9d35-b0781afa366e",
                                                "text": "Le temps amortit les couleurs et rend la peinture plus harmonieuse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08d35711-302c-4157-bdb9-4ec5175781f7",
                                                "sense_id": "d4111f12-a288-32d4-9d35-b0781afa366e",
                                                "text": "Amortir le bruit de la rue par une double fenêtre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2da14e80-810f-4e7d-bbf0-84b303f6a6cc",
                                                "sense_id": "d4111f12-a288-32d4-9d35-b0781afa366e",
                                                "text": "Amortir les feux, les ardeurs de la jeunesse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77cf7827-1adf-453a-9793-ec08bcc3a8f2",
                                                "sense_id": "d4111f12-a288-32d4-9d35-b0781afa366e",
                                                "text": "Amortir les passions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa8fef44-343e-45ec-b653-fd57d32de3ad",
                                                "sense_id": "d4111f12-a288-32d4-9d35-b0781afa366e",
                                                "text": "Cette découverte amortit son amour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86a89764-5f3d-3452-ab99-773d6583737f",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Couronner un élément architectural par un motif, une statue, un fleuron, que l'on nomme alors amortissement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d07f7dd1-370e-4e28-b725-272f16057783",
                                                "sense_id": "86a89764-5f3d-3452-ab99-773d6583737f",
                                                "text": "Un jeu d'ombre ôte à la construction sa sécheresse. Des considérations analogues ont conduit les architectes à amortir la partie sommitale des goutterots par une retraite."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62b51d3c-d619-362c-bf4e-0708b42507a7",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Constater dans les comptes la dégradation dans le temps, de la valeur d'une immobilisation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d005bf9-07a5-47af-8489-6e40347a4034",
                                                "sense_id": "62b51d3c-d619-362c-bf4e-0708b42507a7",
                                                "text": "Amortir une dette, un emprunt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55d41164-a1a7-4f40-8337-85094f659924",
                                                "sense_id": "62b51d3c-d619-362c-bf4e-0708b42507a7",
                                                "text": "Le chagrin que ne manquerait pas de me causer sa perte était déjà réparti sur plusieurs années de mon enfance, et par conséquent presque « amorti », comme un vieil immeuble."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a777604-6c1d-3adc-b04c-5f940241d8f1",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Éteindre en remboursant le capital, en désintéressant le créancier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "En parlant d’une somme due"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "541edd06-acdc-31d6-aaf4-996a73bf1d2b",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Atténuer les effets de la chute ou de la vibration d'un corps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "physical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eaa7006-bb25-4387-9a23-7aeded0af251",
                                                "sense_id": "541edd06-acdc-31d6-aaf4-996a73bf1d2b",
                                                "text": "Comment diminuer les effets sur le corps humain d'une chute ou d'une collision? En amortissant; ce qui signifie une immobilisation rapide, mais pas trop."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "664dfb40-6477-3e3b-a62c-9ba472e06221",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Être atténué dans sa vigueur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pronominal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "570b4509-d8ca-451b-b3c6-f4a30ea7de81",
                                                "sense_id": "664dfb40-6477-3e3b-a62c-9ba472e06221",
                                                "text": "On voyait ses yeux noirs briller puis, tout à coup, à la suite d'une dilatation volontaire des pupilles, cet éclat s'amortissait pour se noyer dans la chaude et trouble aimantation des prunelles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b545094d-1c74-4488-8959-e20dd31a94a9",
                                                "sense_id": "664dfb40-6477-3e3b-a62c-9ba472e06221",
                                                "text": "Rien n'est plus malaisé que l'exploitation méthodique d'un évènement du cœur, rien ne s'amortit plus vite que les ondes d'un coup de foudre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19bcba35-e794-32db-9b4f-a2e2c0479fd0",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Devenir moins vif, moins éclatant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pronominal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e410803-8849-4cd3-9a6b-b77e3710edfa",
                                                "sense_id": "19bcba35-e794-32db-9b4f-a2e2c0479fd0",
                                                "text": "Ces couleurs se sont amorties avec le temps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5f9def2-7dec-413a-9c13-171ebb12e1c1",
                                                "sense_id": "19bcba35-e794-32db-9b4f-a2e2c0479fd0",
                                                "text": "Depuis quelque temps la santé de Clarimonde n’était plus aussi bonne ; son teint s’amortissait de jour en jour."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ddfdd32-5707-3a6d-9370-bcb98ff407ed",
                                        "entry_id": "83884c1d-c59e-356a-bff4-d6ebb65827d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Être atténué par la rencontre d'une surface molle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pronominal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11aa9f32-2e5e-4487-a320-909b8b5949de",
                                                "sense_id": "7ddfdd32-5707-3a6d-9370-bcb98ff407ed",
                                                "text": "Le coup s’est amorti contre la cuirasse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
